{"id":"d83b2898ee4390d1","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-semigroup-word-consequence.md","title":"Semantic Consequence of Word Relations","display":"df-semigroup-word-consequence — Semantic Consequence of Word Relations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-semigroup-word-consequence","aliases":["68-df-semigroup-word-consequence"],"display":"df-semigroup-word-consequence — Semantic Consequence of Word Relations","depends_on":["[[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 p.32 / PDF 41","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-semigroup-word-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-semigroup-word-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semigroup-word-consequence — Semantic Consequence of Word Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2a2b4650e47dbfa\" href=\"?note=b2a2b4650e47dbfa\" title=\"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup\">68-df-shoenfield-semigroup</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 p.32 / PDF 41"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2a2b4650e47dbfa\" href=\"?note=b2a2b4650e47dbfa\" title=\"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup\">68-df-shoenfield-semigroup</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是任意集合候选；量化的是集合载体的结构，不量化真类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land\\forall(A,B)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land\\forall(A,B)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}(\\Omega,R,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,X,Y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}(\\Omega,R,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,X,Y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 §10，印刷 p.32 / PDF p.41 的 R⇒X=Y。R 中的有序对在这里代表等式，其模型含义是对称的；这不同于过程里的单向替换。原书使用 class 载体，这里在 ZFC 元理论中采用任意集合载体；后面的可数词商本身已提供反模型，因而该后承与重写对应不依赖额外的真类结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup","status":"resolved","id":"b2a2b4650e47dbfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-shoenfield-semigroup","status":"resolved","id":"b2a2b4650e47dbfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 有限，$R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2$ 有限，$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。$\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}$ 与 $\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]]。$M$ 是任意集合候选；量化的是集合载体的结构，不量化真类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^2","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{\\Omega SG}_{68}(\\Omega,M)\\land\\forall(A,B)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}(\\Omega,R,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}(\\Omega,R,M)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{WordEq}_{68}(M,X,Y)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1747,"backlinks":[{"id":"025904fb02a2295f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。$R=W$，但其有序对在 $\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}$ 中解释为等式。$\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}$、$[X]_{\\Omega,W}$、$M_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-presented-word-semigroup]]；$\\operatorname{RelModel}_{68}$ 与 $\\operatorname{SGCon}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-semigroup-word-consequence]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-semigroup-word-consequence]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-semigroup-word-consequence]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-semigroup-word-consequence|df-semigroup-word-consequence — Semantic Consequence of Word Relations]]"}],"outgoing":["b2a2b4650e47dbfa"]}